# Thirty-sixth bounded source-first combinatorial lane

2026-09-07 UTC. Owner `/root/thirty_third_finite_scout`.
Same final open seat of the existing batch; not a new batch or paper.

Authorized ceiling: at most three literal finite autonomous maps after
quick original/source subtraction, and at most one minimal complete
small-box pilot after its exact carrier/update/bounds/dependencies are
pinned. These are ceilings, not quotas. Zero pilots is an acceptable
closure if value/proof/source subtraction eliminates the slate first.
No larger box, partial sampling, silent rule repair or automatic lane 37.

Begin with varied combinatorial settings: finite-word block structure,
rooted/ordered structures, and set partitions. Previously rejected OTC,
MPL, ORR, LNR and NED are exclusions, not reserves to rescue. A candidate
needs a rigid full-carrier temporal/recurrent mechanism and a materially
separate evaluated inverse/fibre/enumeration/extremal residual. Generic
finiteness, coarsening, scalar potential, standard transform/conjugacy or
plain counting language alone receives no admission credit.

The project skill/workflow, research-lit and proof-writer are used for
actual source/proof scouting. All were read completely before execution.
Optional unavailable library tools are not simulated. Bounded original
notes and primary web bodies replace a broad automatic library traversal.
Metadata or a source non-hit is not full-body reading or owner clearance.

Only this new directory may be written. Native documentary commands retain
argv/cwd, complete raw output, exits and before/after input hashes. Control
files are copied/pinned before their body read; later root changes use
those exact copied-control identities rather than pretending live indexes
are immutable. Candidate scientific execution, if any, needs a separate
explicit pre-pilot contract and complete canonical output.

Body-path filtering occurs before searching: deny protected P208/P209,
OFS/FTH, review/QA/freeze/build/capsule/history snapshots, and conservatively
deny old mixed tenth/nineteenth/twentieth lane directories. Large filename
sets are saved as raw discovery receipts but not dumped into chat. Literal
proof/source inputs are selected and read exactly before any theorem or
collision claim is made.

All new mathematical deductions and any future kernel in this lane are
author contributions by this owner, not independent review. No paper
number, candidate admission, central edit, Git operation, specialist contact,
external manuscript upload or release is authorized. HOLD_EXTERNAL remains.
